{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1XaW50ZXItS2luZy0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"The Winter King","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fYx5q9hPAmbDrWzsYUDhxZJnigC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1dj1BYNBt4bictaUJPbszPiDCnc.jpg","description":"Bastard son Arthur returns to the land he's been banished from to find a kingdom in chaos. Seeking the aid of his oldest confidants, Arthur aims to right Britain's path as he faces the most unexpected of obstacles.\n\nRated TV-MA · Canceled · First aired 21 Dec 2023 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 50 min\nStudio: Bad Wolf, One Big Picture · Network: ITVX\n\nNot complete. On your server: S1 8/10 (missing E9-10)\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Action & Adventure","Drama","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1XaW50ZXItS2luZy0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-12-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"High King Uther banishes his son Arthur, who rescues a dying boy named Derfel. Arthur entrusts Derfel to Merlin and Nimue. Years later, Uther has a new heir, but Merlin has a dark vision for the future.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iSnAg64f5gkt4avoLmLJuA2MI2i.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1XaW50ZXItS2luZy0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-12-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"An untimely death leads Merlin to locate Arthur and urge him to come back to Britain; chaos ensues when Gundleus assaults Avalon.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kLlaJfArrd5h6vpRQFJRDJF9kWv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1XaW50ZXItS2luZy0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"202